{"id":"7c86c0c2d460d62a","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-haver-sawyer.md","title":"Cofinality-Bounded Exponentiation","display":"thm-haver-sawyer — Cofinality-Bounded Exponentiation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-haver-sawyer","aliases":["58-thm-haver-sawyer"],"display":"thm-haver-sawyer — Cofinality-Bounded Exponentiation","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-cardinal-arithmetic.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-haver-sawyer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-haver-sawyer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-haver-sawyer — Cofinality-Bounded Exponentiation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"80dcb26cf7d15754\" href=\"?note=80dcb26cf7d15754\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-cardinal-arithmetic.md\">../batch07/58-df-cardinal-arithmetic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\)</span>（候选无限基数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>（基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 的共尾数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^{&lt;\\theta}\\coloneqq\\sup_{\\mu&lt;\\theta}\\lambda^\\mu\">\\(\\lambda^{&lt;\\theta}\\coloneqq\\sup_{\\mu&lt;\\theta}\\lambda^\\mu\\)</span>（有界指数记号）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}haver\\text{-}sawyer}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\lambda^{&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\right)\n\\to\\lambda^\\kappa=\\lambda\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}haver\\text{-}sawyer}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\lambda^{&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\right)\n\\to\\lambda^\\kappa=\\lambda\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^{&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda^{&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\)</span> 的直接分量结论：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\">\\(\\kappa&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^\\kappa\\le\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda^\\kappa\\le\\lambda\\)</span>，而无限基数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\le\\lambda^\\kappa\">\\(\\lambda\\le\\lambda^\\kappa\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>原文件的 “Haver–Sawyer” 归属及公式没有可靠来源，故不再把该等式陈述为具名定理；文件名仅作为兼容性标签保留。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-cardinal-arithmetic.md","status":"resolved","id":"80dcb26cf7d15754","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-cardinal-arithmetic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$（基数谓词，见 [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)$（$\\lambda$ 的共尾数，见 [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^{<\\theta}\\coloneqq\\sup_{\\mu<\\theta}\\lambda^\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}haver\\text{-}sawyer}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa<\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\lambda^{<\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)}=\\lambda\\right)\n\\to\\lambda^\\kappa=\\lambda","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda^{<\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)}=\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa<\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^\\kappa\\le\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\le\\lambda^\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1369,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-thm-haver-sawyer.md|58-thm-haver-sawyer]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["80dcb26cf7d15754","5fb1c2241d1943d1","315ad00b8744fdfc"]}